    <string name="about_intro" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Your words, spoken on your device. A private voice reader powered by Kyutai Pocket TTS.</string>
    <string name="about_reader_title" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Read at your own pace</string>
    <string name="about_reader_body" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Read long documents with spoken-section highlighting, an audio waveform and seeking. Pause, resume, adjust speed from 0.50× to 2.00×, listen in the background or export a WAV. Also available as an Android system text-to-speech engine.</string>
    <string name="about_voices_title" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Make a voice your own</string>
    <string name="about_voices_body" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Record a voice sample, import a WAV or extract audio from a video. Sources can be up to 30 minutes and 256 MB of WAV audio. Trim a 3–30 second section, reduce noise with DeepFilterNet3 and compare Before and After. Keep the original and use your chosen sample for a custom voice.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Local by design</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Speech generation and sample enhancement run offline using installed models. Documents, models and voice samples stay in private app storage unless you export them. Only clone voices with the speaker’s permission.</string>
    <string name="about_credits_title" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Built with open source</string>
    <string name="about_credits_body" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Pocket TTS / PocketTTS.cpp · ONNX Runtime · SentencePiece · dr_libs · DeepFilterNet3 · speech-core · KissFFT. Copyright belongs to their respective authors. Original third-party licenses and notices are preserved.</string>
    <string name="about_notices" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Voice enhancement licenses and notices</string>
